WEBVTT

1
00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:41.958
MY BELOVED DEMON

2
00:00:58.683 --> 00:00:59.642
{\an8}There is none.

3
00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.398
{\an8}We managed to survive.

4
00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:15.700
I thought that really...

5
00:01:55.865 --> 00:01:57.283
who are you

6
00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:00.829
Who are you anyway?

7
00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:02.622
What did you do to me?

8
00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:51.254
EPISODE 2
EVERYONE HAS A DEMON IN THEIR HEART

9
00:03:39.177 --> 00:03:40.178
Mrs. To.

10
00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.514
- Ms. Sin.
- Is everything okay?

11
00:03:44.098 --> 00:03:46.267
I just had a nightmare.

12
00:03:47.644 --> 00:03:49.646
What exactly did you dream about? You sweated.

13
00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.360
Glad to see you've recovered.

14
00:03:56.277 --> 00:03:58.196
I was very worried.

15
00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:03.576
Do I still have nightmares?

16
00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.621
relax The horror is over.

17
00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:14.212
I took you to the hospital after
when he called me

18
00:04:14.295 --> 00:04:15.129
To the hospital?

19
00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:18.174
God Am I hurt?

20
00:04:18.258 --> 00:04:20.218
I don't have time for that.

21
00:04:20.301 --> 00:04:22.178
- How long was I unconscious?
- If exactly,

22
00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:25.723
then you slept deeply for 5 hours and 38 minutes.

23
00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:28.768
Then I slept.

24
00:04:28.851 --> 00:04:30.144
How do you feel?

25
00:04:30.812 --> 00:04:32.855
Dizzy, can't move your hands?

26
00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:33.982
Is something bothering you?

27
00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:37.110
- Why are you behaving so strangely?
- Lie down a little.

28
00:04:37.193 --> 00:04:39.988
you should rest
until the doctor says it's okay.

29
00:04:46.327 --> 00:04:48.746
I'll go get a doctor.

30
00:04:55.586 --> 00:04:56.421
What?

31
00:04:58.381 --> 00:04:59.382
What did you do?

32
00:05:01.009 --> 00:05:02.343
What are you talking about?

33
00:05:02.427 --> 00:05:04.178
Yes, it already looks like you.

34
00:05:04.262 --> 00:05:06.556
You are not at all gentle and attentive.

35
00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:08.766
You didn't want me
considered your ex.

36
00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:10.977
So I showed courtesy, as you asked.

37
00:05:11.561 --> 00:05:13.938
Now they think we are dating.

38
00:05:14.022 --> 00:05:17.442
You don't like everything, what should I do?

39
00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.031
The police arrested the attacker,
who hit us with a car?

40
00:05:23.531 --> 00:05:24.741
He will be arrested soon.

41
00:05:24.824 --> 00:05:27.118
I gave them a detailed description.

42
00:05:27.201 --> 00:05:28.536
It should be very simple.

43
00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:33.166
But are you sure everything is okay?

44
00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:39.130
I'm in pain
and in general everything is fine with me.

45
00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:41.674
It seems that with you...

46
00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:45.261
everything is fine

47
00:05:45.845 --> 00:05:47.972
Unfortunately, everything is completely wrong with me.

48
00:05:48.056 --> 00:05:49.807
That's why I was waiting for you.

49
00:05:52.477 --> 00:05:53.311
What?

50
00:05:53.895 --> 00:05:55.271
What kind of tattoo sticker is this?

51
00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:57.148
"Sticker tattoo"?

52
00:05:57.231 --> 00:05:59.734
What is this abomination on my hand?

53
00:05:59.817 --> 00:06:00.777
"Abomination"?

54
00:06:01.778 --> 00:06:03.071
What do you think you are doing?

55
00:06:03.154 --> 00:06:04.363
- No need.
- Does not rub off.

56
00:06:05.323 --> 00:06:07.533
Godi You can spoil it.

57
00:06:08.826 --> 00:06:09.660
Not at all.

58
00:06:11.829 --> 00:06:13.247
Is this a real tattoo?

59
00:06:13.331 --> 00:06:15.083
What happened last night?

60
00:06:26.344 --> 00:06:27.762
Good. You start to remember.

61
00:06:27.845 --> 00:06:29.722
It would be bad if you didn't already know...

62
00:06:29.806 --> 00:06:32.100
Am I that drunk?

63
00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:34.894
Are we in Honte or what?

64
00:06:35.686 --> 00:06:38.439
Why didn't you try to turn me down?

65
00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:40.942
Okay, I'll destroy the tattoo with a laser.

66
00:06:41.526 --> 00:06:42.819
No lasers!

67
00:06:44.946 --> 00:06:46.531
what are you doing step away

68
00:06:46.614 --> 00:06:48.241
Through my corpse.

69
00:06:48.324 --> 00:06:49.867
And how can you stop me?

70
00:06:49.951 --> 00:06:52.954
How about I destroy him with a laser
shall I hide Pororo?

71
00:06:53.538 --> 00:06:54.372
Pororo?

72
00:06:57.583 --> 00:06:59.544
Don't even touch your wrist.

73
00:06:59.627 --> 00:07:01.254
Are you…

74
00:07:01.337 --> 00:07:02.213
you will regret it.

75
00:07:04.298 --> 00:07:06.175
- This is my wrist.
- This is my dad.

76
00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:07.260
What kind of delusion is this?

77
00:07:07.343 --> 00:07:09.846
For unknown reasons
it's on your wrist now

78
00:07:10.805 --> 00:07:12.014
but this is my dad.

79
00:07:12.765 --> 00:07:14.100
are you crazy

80
00:07:14.684 --> 00:07:15.893
- Let go.
- No.

81
00:07:15.977 --> 00:07:18.146
- I say, let it go.
- I say, no.

82
00:07:19.814 --> 00:07:20.815
Better let go.

83
00:07:20.898 --> 00:07:21.899
No.

84
00:07:21.983 --> 00:07:22.984
Who knows what you will do with it?

85
00:07:23.067 --> 00:07:24.610
This is the last warning.

86
00:07:24.694 --> 00:07:27.071
One, two, three.

87
00:07:35.788 --> 00:07:37.582
Why can't I…

88
00:07:48.634 --> 00:07:49.469
That's it.

89
00:07:54.807 --> 00:07:55.850
I knew that.

90
00:07:55.933 --> 00:07:58.311
I didn't want to hit that hard.

91
00:07:58.394 --> 00:08:00.229
I tried to force my hand to move.

92
00:08:01.689 --> 00:08:03.900
How dare you steal mine
when did i save you

93
00:08:05.359 --> 00:08:06.277
Steal?

94
00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:07.487
I must have gone crazy.

95
00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:10.990
Should have just left you
to kill you

96
00:08:11.073 --> 00:08:12.450
This is my cue.

97
00:08:12.533 --> 00:08:15.203
It was necessary to leave
such a scoundrel is food for fish.

98
00:08:15.786 --> 00:08:18.915
I just saved you
so as not to drown. Do you want my tattoo?

99
00:08:18.998 --> 00:08:20.708
Of course. I saved you!

100
00:08:27.298 --> 00:08:28.883
How do you feel?

101
00:08:28.966 --> 00:08:30.301
Doctor, can you examine...

102
00:08:30.384 --> 00:08:32.970
I am very embarrassed.

103
00:08:33.054 --> 00:08:34.138
Sorry?

104
00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.349
Let me check my eyes.

105
00:08:37.308 --> 00:08:39.393
Sir, she's not going to be okay, is she?

106
00:08:39.477 --> 00:08:42.063
No, I mean… She'll be fine, right?

107
00:08:42.146 --> 00:08:43.856
Signs of exhaustion disappeared.

108
00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.816
- It seems that everything is fine.
- What?

109
00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.235
What are you talking about, doctor?

110
00:08:47.318 --> 00:08:49.362
I'm sure I'm crazy.

111
00:08:52.782 --> 00:08:54.909
Mrs. To is an extraordinary person.

112
00:08:54.992 --> 00:08:57.411
Her sense of humor does not betray her
even in hard times.

113
00:08:58.829 --> 00:09:00.873
Of course. Then…

114
00:09:06.587 --> 00:09:07.964
<i>His name was Jung Ku Won?</i>

115
00:09:08.047 --> 00:09:10.883
Are you about a good and rude victim?

116
00:09:12.927 --> 00:09:15.263
I thought about him.

117
00:09:15.346 --> 00:09:16.514
Why?

118
00:09:16.597 --> 00:09:17.974
I wonder where he buys his clothes.

119
00:09:18.057 --> 00:09:19.141
Is it expensive?

120
00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:20.643
I'd look good in that too, right?

121
00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.689
You don't want his clothes.

122
00:09:24.772 --> 00:09:27.233
- And what?
- His face, body

123
00:09:27.316 --> 00:09:28.859
and his entire existence.

124
00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:35.908
Congratulations.

125
00:09:36.659 --> 00:09:39.829
I'm Sergeant Park Kyung-soo, I'm handling your case.

126
00:09:42.206 --> 00:09:43.291
You are still here.

127
00:09:43.874 --> 00:09:46.127
I wanted to make sure everything was okay.

128
00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.963
As you can see, everything is quite good.
So you can go.

129
00:09:49.046 --> 00:09:50.548
What a relief to hear that.

130
00:09:51.132 --> 00:09:54.468
I asked them not to tell anyone
including Chu's head.

131
00:09:54.552 --> 00:09:55.386
Good.

132
00:09:55.469 --> 00:09:57.138
sorry to bother you

133
00:09:57.221 --> 00:09:59.181
but we need your application.

134
00:09:59.265 --> 00:10:00.766
The most important thing is to catch the criminal.

135
00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:02.476
by the way

136
00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.437
I heard you met on a blind date.

137
00:10:05.021 --> 00:10:06.188
Considering what happened

138
00:10:06.272 --> 00:10:08.566
maybe you two should get married.

139
00:10:08.649 --> 00:10:09.692
- No.
- No.

140
00:10:12.612 --> 00:10:14.322
I don't plan to get married.

141
00:10:14.405 --> 00:10:15.656
I plan to be alone all my life.

142
00:10:17.867 --> 00:10:21.245
But they went on a blind date.

143
00:10:21.329 --> 00:10:22.413
There is a saying.

144
00:10:22.496 --> 00:10:25.499
"Blind dates and accidents
sometimes become beyond our control"

145
00:10:25.583 --> 00:10:27.376
You may equally be partly to blame

146
00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.128
because they did not keep their distance.

147
00:10:35.718 --> 00:10:37.094
EXPIRATION OF THE AGREEMENT

148
00:10:37.178 --> 00:10:38.763
I have to go somewhere.

149
00:10:38.846 --> 00:10:40.306
Of course, go.

150
00:10:41.307 --> 00:10:44.018
Respect yourself, Mrs. To To Hee.

151
00:10:44.101 --> 00:10:47.730
Stay away until we meet
from lasers and Poro...

152
00:10:49.523 --> 00:10:51.359
And Pororo.

153
00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:54.737
Be there.

154
00:11:02.495 --> 00:11:04.121
Write it down. "Lazers and Pororo".

155
00:11:04.205 --> 00:11:05.289
Let it be between us.

156
00:11:12.213 --> 00:11:14.632
{\an8}"SUNVOL FOUNDATION"

157
00:11:14.715 --> 00:11:16.967
{\an8}EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR JEONG KOO WON

158
00:11:17.051 --> 00:11:19.053
{\an8}"DEMON"

159
00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:40.991
Give it back

160
00:11:44.412 --> 00:11:45.663
"Demons exist for deals.

161
00:11:45.746 --> 00:11:48.290
If the demon does not make a deal
does not complete them on time,

162
00:11:48.374 --> 00:11:49.708
spontaneous combustion will begin..."

163
00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.128
"Spontaneous combustion"?

164
00:11:52.795 --> 00:11:54.004
Do not touch my things!

165
00:11:54.088 --> 00:11:56.507
What? I am your employee. We are almost a family...

166
00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:57.758
hold on

167
00:11:57.842 --> 00:12:00.636
How did you find her? I am her
hid it where no one would find it.

168
00:12:00.719 --> 00:12:02.263
I was just cleaning and…

169
00:12:02.346 --> 00:12:03.639
Just give it a look.

170
00:12:03.722 --> 00:12:06.350
As your butler I have the right
read the instructions to the demons.

171
00:12:06.434 --> 00:12:07.768
"Instructions"?

172
00:12:07.852 --> 00:12:09.270
What am I to you, a vacuum cleaner?

173
00:12:10.521 --> 00:12:12.064
And what is it then?

174
00:12:12.148 --> 00:12:15.317
Here is all the information about me.
What can you call this instrument...

175
00:12:15.818 --> 00:12:16.902
What?

176
00:12:18.154 --> 00:12:20.489
But this is very important.

177
00:12:20.573 --> 00:12:22.074
So don't go near her.

178
00:12:22.158 --> 00:12:23.075
I'm serious.

179
00:12:37.965 --> 00:12:38.799
by the way

180
00:12:39.884 --> 00:12:41.177
spontaneous combustion

181
00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:43.471
means you'll burn out?

182
00:12:45.097 --> 00:12:47.266
God, how scary.

183
00:12:47.349 --> 00:12:48.851
How often should you enter into new agreements?

184
00:12:48.934 --> 00:12:49.894
Weekly? Monthly?

185
00:12:49.977 --> 00:12:50.895
I don't know.

186
00:12:50.978 --> 00:12:52.897
That's why I'm even more worried.

187
00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.106
I knew so.

188
00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:56.567
All that hard work
did not seem inherent in you.

189
00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:57.568
Time already.

190
00:12:59.487 --> 00:13:00.821
Learn all about this woman.

191
00:13:02.323 --> 00:13:04.575
CEO TO TO HI

192
00:13:04.658 --> 00:13:06.285
- "To To Hee"?
- About her family,

193
00:13:06.368 --> 00:13:08.412
blood group
former relationships, roommates,

194
00:13:08.496 --> 00:13:11.332
even her main preferences, in particular,

195
00:13:11.415 --> 00:13:13.709
her tansuyuk sauce
like on a dish or on its own.

196
00:13:15.002 --> 00:13:18.506
Who is this woman that you are so fascinated by her?

197
00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:21.509
The woman I met yesterday
so you are interested?

198
00:13:21.592 --> 00:13:23.636
- She is a thief.
- Did she steal your heart?

199
00:13:24.929 --> 00:13:27.306
I really don't like your look.

200
00:13:31.268 --> 00:13:32.269
Wait, it's not there.

201
00:13:33.729 --> 00:13:35.481
What? What is not?

202
00:13:35.564 --> 00:13:36.732
Tattoo

203
00:13:36.815 --> 00:13:38.400
That's what you're talking about.

204
00:13:38.484 --> 00:13:39.652
What am I talking about?

205
00:13:39.735 --> 00:13:42.071
Has anything else disappeared?

206
00:13:42.655 --> 00:13:43.489
No.

207
00:13:46.909 --> 00:13:50.162
If you think about it, you seem different.

208
00:13:50.246 --> 00:13:52.581
Absolutely not. What are you talking about?

209
00:13:54.208 --> 00:13:55.876
- No?
- No.

210
00:13:58.045 --> 00:13:58.879
OK.

211
00:14:14.019 --> 00:14:14.979
Your powers are gone.

212
00:14:16.564 --> 00:14:18.232
This is something new.

213
00:14:18.315 --> 00:14:19.400
Hold on.

214
00:14:19.483 --> 00:14:21.819
If the strength is gone, then you will burn to ashes,

215
00:14:21.902 --> 00:14:23.904
and I will suddenly become unemployed?

216
00:14:24.738 --> 00:14:26.824
I still have to pay off my new car!

217
00:14:26.907 --> 00:14:29.285
Is that what worries you the most?

218
00:14:29.368 --> 00:14:31.245
It's terrible, I'm out of energy!

219
00:14:32.162 --> 00:14:34.373
You have lost your strength. I was right.

220
00:14:34.957 --> 00:14:36.500
No, I didn't lose them.

221
00:14:36.584 --> 00:14:38.294
- I just...
- What?

222
00:14:40.796 --> 00:14:43.257
I lent them to someone for a short time.

223
00:14:45.301 --> 00:14:47.720
That is, to this thief? What happened?

224
00:14:49.096 --> 00:14:50.055
I don't know.

225
00:14:50.139 --> 00:14:51.765
Whatever she did, my strength

226
00:14:51.849 --> 00:14:53.934
stopped listening
and dad moved to her.

227
00:14:54.018 --> 00:14:56.186
- We need more details.
- Then.

228
00:14:56.687 --> 00:14:58.480
Where are you? To regain strength?

229
00:14:58.564 --> 00:15:00.858
The agreement expires today. This is the main thing.

230
00:15:00.941 --> 00:15:02.860
What can you do without your strength?

231
00:15:04.028 --> 00:15:06.155
What are you talking about? I am a demon.

232
00:15:06.238 --> 00:15:08.699
I've been a demon for at least 200 years.

233
00:15:08.782 --> 00:15:10.951
Collecting souls is not more difficult for me,
than chewing gum.

234
00:15:24.173 --> 00:15:25.966
Do not spit chewing gum everywhere.

235
00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:28.260
You know how difficult it is to remove dried chewing gum from…

236
00:15:29.929 --> 00:15:31.722
What do you think? Do you like it?

237
00:15:32.306 --> 00:15:33.557
to be honest

238
00:15:33.641 --> 00:15:35.851
I've never worked so hard
even at the Olympics.

239
00:15:35.935 --> 00:15:37.645
Although it is very touching,

240
00:15:37.728 --> 00:15:39.021
time to say goodbye beautifully.

241
00:15:40.147 --> 00:15:41.690
I figured it out here.

242
00:15:42.858 --> 00:15:45.819
A deal that asks too much

243
00:15:45.903 --> 00:15:47.279
is considered a dishonest instrument.

244
00:15:47.863 --> 00:15:51.241
That is, I do not owe you anything.

245
00:15:51.325 --> 00:15:53.410
I'm so sick of it.

246
00:15:53.494 --> 00:15:55.412
People are becoming more and more shameless.

247
00:15:55.996 --> 00:15:58.207
It seems that you do not understand who you are dealing with.

248
00:15:58.707 --> 00:16:00.376
So I'll show you now.

249
00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.461
Attack one at a time.

250
00:16:02.544 --> 00:16:04.046
He wants to show something. attack

251
00:16:04.129 --> 00:16:05.714
Ahead. Let's see what he can do.

252
00:16:07.257 --> 00:16:08.467
I said one at a time.

253
00:16:09.885 --> 00:16:10.719
One at a time.

254
00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:11.887
How dare you!

255
00:16:13.263 --> 00:16:15.099
Where is the sportsmanship?

256
00:16:27.987 --> 00:16:29.071
Attack him!

257
00:16:35.828 --> 00:16:37.538
Haven't I hit you yet?

258
00:16:37.621 --> 00:16:39.331
Why are you all so alike?

259
00:16:44.878 --> 00:16:45.963
From the road.

260
00:16:53.053 --> 00:16:55.097
I really didn't want to do this, but…

261
00:17:16.618 --> 00:17:18.203
Just wait.

262
00:17:18.287 --> 00:17:20.998
I'll show you, don't forget the contract.

263
00:17:21.081 --> 00:17:23.083
Go ahead, you fool.

264
00:17:24.293 --> 00:17:26.545
show me

265
00:17:28.338 --> 00:17:29.465
To the scoundrel.

266
00:17:32.843 --> 00:17:33.886
Don't drop it!

267
00:17:39.808 --> 00:17:42.102
I sent your battered car to the junkyard

268
00:17:42.186 --> 00:17:45.064
and got you a new one.

269
00:17:45.939 --> 00:17:48.776
He just ate alone in the same restaurant

270
00:17:49.526 --> 00:17:51.653
and came to the coastal road
that evening

271
00:17:52.488 --> 00:17:54.531
It can't just be a coincidence.

272
00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.117
I am 100% sure that it is…

273
00:17:57.201 --> 00:17:58.327
Fate?

274
00:18:00.996 --> 00:18:03.457
I didn't know you were so romantic.

275
00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.459
Excuse me for being romantic.

276
00:18:05.542 --> 00:18:06.877
He thought of something.

277
00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:10.047
He must be with me all the time
waiting for the right moment.

278
00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:11.006
To do what?

279
00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:13.258
To make a deal with me.

280
00:18:13.842 --> 00:18:16.637
He talked all about the deal,
when I almost died

281
00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:18.806
What can it be about
if he is ready for this?

282
00:18:18.889 --> 00:18:20.057
That's right.

283
00:18:20.641 --> 00:18:22.267
I don't think it's worth my time.

284
00:18:22.351 --> 00:18:24.770
The fact that he is so stubborn and cunning,

285
00:18:25.354 --> 00:18:28.023
means that the deal is mutually beneficial.

286
00:18:30.317 --> 00:18:31.527
Did you get a tattoo?

287
00:18:32.111 --> 00:18:33.278
You have to stop drinking.

288
00:18:34.488 --> 00:18:37.324
It's only been 24 hours
after the release of the article about sugar,

289
00:18:37.407 --> 00:18:38.909
and we already have a 10% drop in shares.

290
00:18:38.992 --> 00:18:41.870
Foreign shareholders
and organizations sell like crazy.

291
00:18:42.913 --> 00:18:44.498
Shall we go to the office?

292
00:18:47.876 --> 00:18:52.005
You will die because of Choo Jung Suk.

293
00:18:53.757 --> 00:18:55.300
I want to see Ms. Chu first.

294
00:18:59.346 --> 00:19:00.889
Detective Paku, the photo robot is ready.

295
00:19:03.976 --> 00:19:05.519
See what details.

296
00:19:06.103 --> 00:19:08.105
{\an8}He will be caught very quickly.

297
00:20:19.259 --> 00:20:20.302
How can I help?

298
00:20:20.385 --> 00:20:23.597
I noticed that the rent
always paid on time,

299
00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.933
but I never see anyone here.

300
00:20:26.683 --> 00:20:27.768
I am the owner of this building.

301
00:20:29.269 --> 00:20:30.812
Can I speak to the director?

302
00:20:30.896 --> 00:20:33.315
No, the troupe is on tour.

303
00:20:33.899 --> 00:20:35.275
I will tell the director to call you.

304
00:20:36.276 --> 00:20:37.110
wait

305
00:20:38.111 --> 00:20:39.863
You seem familiar. are you an actor

306
00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.492
- Yes.
- How long have you been working here?

307
00:20:43.575 --> 00:20:45.452
Why have I never seen you?

308
00:20:45.535 --> 00:20:48.247
I recently came back after a break.

309
00:20:49.706 --> 00:20:53.126
You probably won't run away from your calling.

310
00:20:54.586 --> 00:20:55.587
You are right.

311
00:20:56.088 --> 00:20:58.340
After trying, I can't stop.

312
00:21:01.176 --> 00:21:02.511
God

313
00:21:02.594 --> 00:21:05.055
Why is your hand covered in blood?

314
00:21:05.639 --> 00:21:07.599
It? Special makeup.

315
00:21:10.394 --> 00:21:12.771
You might think you killed a person or something.

316
00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:16.608
Please tell the director
that I want to meet

317
00:21:16.692 --> 00:21:17.901
Actually...

318
00:21:17.985 --> 00:21:19.361
BLUE NIGHT THEATER

319
00:21:20.696 --> 00:21:23.073
Our ceiling is leaking.

320
00:21:24.241 --> 00:21:25.993
Started again?

321
00:21:26.576 --> 00:21:27.911
can you look

322
00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:41.800
THE PERFORMANCE IS GOING ON
DO NOT ENTER

323
00:21:42.551 --> 00:21:44.094
- Mrs. Chu.
- Hello.

324
00:21:44.678 --> 00:21:45.679
Is everything ready?

325
00:21:46.471 --> 00:21:48.223
Yes, I'm fine.

326
00:21:49.391 --> 00:21:50.600
Glad to hear that.

327
00:21:50.684 --> 00:21:52.644
Doesn't that calm you down?

328
00:21:52.728 --> 00:21:54.229
It wasn't that bad, was it?

329
00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.231
But I just wasted my time.

330
00:21:58.025 --> 00:21:59.860
I wonder how my little plants are doing.

331
00:21:59.943 --> 00:22:01.987
We must hurry home and fertilize them.

332
00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:03.405
Let me give you a ride.

333
00:22:03.989 --> 00:22:04.990
Aren't you busy?

334
00:22:05.073 --> 00:22:08.201
I saw that the market value of the business
fell by 260 million.

335
00:22:08.285 --> 00:22:09.453
I oppose it.

336
00:22:10.037 --> 00:22:10.996
Who was it?

337
00:22:12.164 --> 00:22:13.332
I don't know yet.

338
00:22:13.874 --> 00:22:15.083
Need my help?

339
00:22:15.167 --> 00:22:16.752
leave it

340
00:22:16.835 --> 00:22:18.670
I've been doing great on my own so far.

341
00:22:18.754 --> 00:22:20.964
It would be difficult
need your help right now.

342
00:22:24.885 --> 00:22:25.886
Ms. Chu.

343
00:22:27.846 --> 00:22:28.680
Come in.

344
00:22:30.724 --> 00:22:33.310
- Mrs. Chu.
- Doctor Choi.

345
00:22:33.393 --> 00:22:35.187
You shouldn't have come to me.

346
00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:37.939
I wanted to make sure
that you were comfortable here.

347
00:22:39.649 --> 00:22:40.859
<i>God.</i>

348
00:22:41.443 --> 00:22:44.237
Everyone has already bowed.

349
00:22:44.905 --> 00:22:46.323
I don't see any changes.

350
00:22:46.907 --> 00:22:47.991
How can you not see?

351
00:22:49.284 --> 00:22:52.537
All the leaves have fallen
while I was gone

352
00:22:55.332 --> 00:22:57.959
You need to rest.
Don't complain about your knees later.

353
00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:01.588
I won't.

354
00:23:02.089 --> 00:23:04.007
I have a whole bunch of pills.

355
00:23:04.091 --> 00:23:06.259
Do you consider pain relievers vitamins?

356
00:23:06.343 --> 00:23:07.594
You drink them so regularly.

357
00:23:08.136 --> 00:23:09.805
I will help Just tell me what to do.

358
00:23:09.888 --> 00:23:11.765
leave it You can't do anything.

359
00:23:11.848 --> 00:23:12.766
Just sit down.

360
00:23:12.849 --> 00:23:15.143
You should not load your knees at all.

361
00:23:15.227 --> 00:23:17.395
All those painkillers will hurt you.

362
00:23:17.479 --> 00:23:18.647
Do you have an addiction or something?

363
00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:21.399
Painkillers are no worse than your grunting.

364
00:23:21.483 --> 00:23:24.319
Pain is simply a part of aging.

365
00:23:25.237 --> 00:23:27.906
It would be worse if I just sat there.

366
00:23:29.783 --> 00:23:30.617
A little

367
00:23:31.201 --> 00:23:32.160
Look at the bud.

368
00:23:33.078 --> 00:23:34.204
How complete.

369
00:23:34.287 --> 00:23:36.289
Will bloom soon.

370
00:23:36.373 --> 00:23:37.290
What a beauty.

371
00:23:38.834 --> 00:23:41.169
I wanted to ask you something.

372
00:23:41.837 --> 00:23:42.879
ask

373
00:23:44.881 --> 00:23:47.551
You sometimes…

374
00:23:47.634 --> 00:23:50.262
These hesitations are not like you.

375
00:23:53.223 --> 00:23:55.392
You're not hiding anything from me, are you?

376
00:23:55.475 --> 00:23:56.643
Of course I hide it.

377
00:23:56.726 --> 00:24:00.730
My veins are not blood, but lies.

378
00:24:01.356 --> 00:24:03.692
Business owners can't be honest.

379
00:24:05.026 --> 00:24:05.944
Ms. Chu.

380
00:24:06.653 --> 00:24:07.654
I'm serious.

381
00:24:13.493 --> 00:24:15.287
If you want, I will be honest.

382
00:24:16.329 --> 00:24:18.206
Are you sure you're not hiding anything?

383
00:24:23.920 --> 00:24:24.880
Exactly.

384
00:24:29.259 --> 00:24:31.219
You notice everything equally.

385
00:24:36.433 --> 00:24:37.434
OK.

386
00:24:38.059 --> 00:24:39.811
I will take your word for it.

387
00:24:40.520 --> 00:24:42.856
After all, you're the only one I can trust.

388
00:24:44.024 --> 00:24:45.775
Did someone say something?

389
00:24:45.859 --> 00:24:47.319
I just got curious.

390
00:24:49.321 --> 00:24:50.405
Stupid

391
00:24:52.240 --> 00:24:53.325
Aunt Jung Suk!

392
00:24:54.701 --> 00:24:57.120
Just look, working
immediately after discharge.

393
00:24:57.204 --> 00:24:58.997
I told her to rest, but she doesn't listen.

394
00:24:59.080 --> 00:25:02.167
I did not manage to raise children well,
therefore, plants are the only hope.

395
00:25:02.667 --> 00:25:04.502
But lately everyone is behaving well.

396
00:25:04.586 --> 00:25:07.547
I know Suk Min has changed dramatically.

397
00:25:07.631 --> 00:25:09.507
Think about his age.

398
00:25:09.591 --> 00:25:10.634
It's long overdue.

399
00:25:11.384 --> 00:25:14.137
I tried so hard
that at least something would reach him.

400
00:25:17.057 --> 00:25:20.477
Here is last quarter's earnings report.

401
00:25:25.273 --> 00:25:26.107
It looks good.

402
00:25:26.191 --> 00:25:28.526
Don't just look at the result.
Appreciate the process too.

403
00:25:28.610 --> 00:25:29.945
I worked so hard.

404
00:25:30.028 --> 00:25:31.363
Is it necessary?

405
00:25:32.948 --> 00:25:34.866
She never praises me.

406
00:25:35.742 --> 00:25:37.035
I'll go now.

407
00:25:37.661 --> 00:25:39.537
I'm coming too, To Hee.

408
00:25:39.621 --> 00:25:40.914
But you just came.

409
00:25:40.997 --> 00:25:44.292
I have to hurry to the office
multiply your wealth.

410
00:25:44.376 --> 00:25:46.044
- Are you in your office?
- Yes.

411
00:25:47.212 --> 00:25:48.546
you two

412
00:25:48.630 --> 00:25:51.466
If all you have in life is work,

413
00:25:51.549 --> 00:25:53.009
maybe you two will get married?

414
00:25:53.093 --> 00:25:54.344
Shall we get married?

415
00:25:54.427 --> 00:25:55.428
Sorry?

416
00:25:55.512 --> 00:25:58.765
Don't laugh. What's wrong with you?

417
00:25:58.848 --> 00:26:00.141
What is so funny here?

418
00:26:00.225 --> 00:26:03.103
You are not related, not registered as a family.

419
00:26:03.186 --> 00:26:04.312
You are funny, aunty.

420
00:26:04.396 --> 00:26:05.855
Ignore her, Seok Hoon.

421
00:26:05.939 --> 00:26:08.108
She really wants to marry me now.

422
00:26:08.191 --> 00:26:09.609
I will go, Ms. Chu.

423
00:26:09.693 --> 00:26:11.611
God knows what else you'll say
if i don't go

424
00:26:11.695 --> 00:26:14.531
Okay, I guess that's unlikely.

425
00:26:14.614 --> 00:26:16.199
- I will come again.
- Don't come.

426
00:26:25.208 --> 00:26:26.584
- Are you going straight to the office?
- Yes.

427
00:26:27.085 --> 00:26:28.086
Can I give you a ride?

428
00:26:28.169 --> 00:26:29.713
Wait, I think you came here.

429
00:26:31.840 --> 00:26:32.799
Actually, no.

430
00:26:33.967 --> 00:26:35.260
I didn't come.

431
00:26:35.343 --> 00:26:36.428
I took a taxi.

432
00:26:36.511 --> 00:26:38.096
Great, let me give you a ride.

433
00:26:38.179 --> 00:26:40.807
- Really?
- Let's go. Haven't ridden for a long time.

434
00:26:41.933 --> 00:26:43.143
Sounds great. Come on.

435
00:26:58.950 --> 00:27:01.036
What is it? Are you confused by something?

436
00:27:01.786 --> 00:27:04.664
No, everything is fine, To Hee.

437
00:27:06.916 --> 00:27:08.752
Looks like you're comfortable, Ms. Sin.

438
00:27:09.836 --> 00:27:12.339
Thank you for giving me time
finish your work

439
00:27:13.715 --> 00:27:15.216
Not worth the gratitude.

440
00:27:15.967 --> 00:27:18.845
Shouldn't we give thanks somehow?
to Mr. Jung Ku Won?

441
00:27:18.928 --> 00:27:20.388
He had already paid for the meal.

442
00:27:20.472 --> 00:27:21.765
Probably worth it.

443
00:27:21.848 --> 00:27:23.516
I think I owe him.

444
00:27:23.600 --> 00:27:25.685
Who is it about?

445
00:27:26.227 --> 00:27:28.772
one man
with whom I went on a blind date.

446
00:27:35.278 --> 00:27:36.905
Are you okay, To Hee?

447
00:27:37.739 --> 00:27:38.990
Yes, everything is fine.

448
00:27:44.537 --> 00:27:45.413
Mrs. Sin.

449
00:27:47.123 --> 00:27:48.124
You have a nosebleed.

450
00:27:48.833 --> 00:27:50.668
- God.
- From both...

451
00:27:51.711 --> 00:27:53.129
From both nostrils... Shut up.

452
00:28:02.263 --> 00:28:04.599
Are you sure you're all right, Ms. Sin?

453
00:28:06.101 --> 00:28:08.061
Everything will be fine if I drive.

454
00:28:09.562 --> 00:28:10.522
Sorry.

455
00:28:13.358 --> 00:28:15.568
It was so shocking that I was
on a blind date?

456
00:28:15.652 --> 00:28:17.946
You're just so young.

457
00:28:18.029 --> 00:28:20.240
And it doesn't look like you.

458
00:28:20.907 --> 00:28:22.450
Why did you go on a blind date?

459
00:28:22.534 --> 00:28:24.077
Why else?

460
00:28:24.160 --> 00:28:25.078
Do you want to get married?

461
00:28:25.995 --> 00:28:26.996
That's not the point.

462
00:28:27.080 --> 00:28:28.832
Ms. Chu begged me.

463
00:28:30.417 --> 00:28:31.835
I have no plans to get married.

464
00:28:31.918 --> 00:28:33.169
Then I don't plan either.

465
00:28:36.172 --> 00:28:37.340
What are you talking about?

466
00:28:38.591 --> 00:28:40.927
Well, since you don't plan on getting married,

467
00:28:41.010 --> 00:28:44.431
I thought that it is so fashionable among young people now.

468
00:28:45.014 --> 00:28:47.350
From what? From kimchi?
From spicy noodle soup?

469
00:28:47.434 --> 00:28:49.018
This is yesterday.

470
00:28:49.102 --> 00:28:51.563
And the tie is half untied. show me

471
00:28:52.063 --> 00:28:54.899
you look perfectly normal
but forever such a slob.

472
00:28:54.983 --> 00:28:57.652
My parents are hippies, remember?

473
00:29:03.158 --> 00:29:04.617
We will try to buy

474
00:29:05.452 --> 00:29:07.996
plenty of "Kharchuvannya Mire" shares,
to level the losses.

475
00:29:08.788 --> 00:29:10.123
That's how the rumor goes

476
00:29:10.206 --> 00:29:12.083
about stock manipulation
and internal sales.

477
00:29:12.167 --> 00:29:15.587
Even from an investment point of view
buying your shares is profitable.

478
00:29:16.463 --> 00:29:17.547
Don't worry.

479
00:29:17.630 --> 00:29:19.299
I will take care of myself.

480
00:29:20.467 --> 00:29:23.636
I forgot for a moment how wonderful you are.

481
00:29:24.220 --> 00:29:26.556
And how strong you are. You almost killed me.

482
00:29:29.100 --> 00:29:32.061
- Let me try again.
- No, I like it.

483
00:29:33.229 --> 00:29:34.939
So pretty, Ms. Xin?

484
00:29:35.732 --> 00:29:37.442
Yes, very much.

485
00:29:38.026 --> 00:29:41.488
No wonder you're a trendsetter, To Hee.

486
00:29:42.906 --> 00:29:44.616
- No need to tease me.
- I'm not teasing.

487
00:29:44.699 --> 00:29:46.284
And how you tease! Allow me one more time.

488
00:29:46.367 --> 00:29:48.578
- Hold on.
- It doesn't look like that.

489
00:29:51.080 --> 00:29:52.624
- I will try again.
- No, everything is fine.

490
00:29:56.461 --> 00:29:57.462
I can't find anything.

491
00:29:57.545 --> 00:30:00.131
No mention of a tattoo transition,

492
00:30:00.215 --> 00:30:01.883
not to mention their return!

493
00:30:01.966 --> 00:30:03.760
"DEMON"

494
00:30:12.811 --> 00:30:15.480
Mr. Pak, have you learned anything about To To Hee?

495
00:30:21.027 --> 00:30:22.821
<i>The name is To To Hee.</i>

496
00:30:22.904 --> 00:30:24.489
<i>Third blood group.</i>

497
00:30:24.572 --> 00:30:27.408
<i>Known as the princess of "Mire Group",
"The devil wears Hermes",</i>

498
00:30:27.492 --> 00:30:28.910
<i>Crazy To To Hee,</i>

499
00:30:28.993 --> 00:30:31.162
<i>and this is not the end of the list.</i>

500
00:30:39.420 --> 00:30:40.421
{\an8}DEVIL

501
00:30:42.715 --> 00:30:44.467
- No!
- This is the Devil!

502
00:30:45.677 --> 00:30:47.971
We pulled out the Devil today!

503
00:30:48.555 --> 00:30:50.348
<i>She is not from a chaebol family.</i>

504
00:30:50.431 --> 00:30:51.724
<i>Her father was an engineer,</i>

505
00:30:51.808 --> 00:30:54.310
<i>developed a metal one
cross bearing for electronics.</i>

506
00:30:54.394 --> 00:30:56.855
<i>Her mother had a hair salon.</i>

507
00:30:56.938 --> 00:30:59.566
<i>She was the only daughter of a late marriage.</i>

508
00:31:00.316 --> 00:31:03.236
But they died in an accident
on her birthday 17 years ago.

509
00:31:03.319 --> 00:31:04.821
To To Hee was then 11 years old.

510
00:31:05.488 --> 00:31:08.867
Then the head of Chu "Mire Group"
sheltered the orphan To To Hee.

511
00:31:08.950 --> 00:31:11.244
Chairman Choo with To Hee's father
were co-founders

512
00:31:11.327 --> 00:31:13.997
"Mire Electronics",
of the main company "Mire Group".

513
00:31:15.373 --> 00:31:18.918
These arrows remind me
situation in the company.

514
00:31:19.002 --> 00:31:22.755
The same feeling as from the songs
about the breakup when you were left.

515
00:31:22.839 --> 00:31:23.882
I did not experience this.

516
00:31:23.965 --> 00:31:25.800
It's because you've never been left.

517
00:31:26.843 --> 00:31:28.011
you say

518
00:31:28.636 --> 00:31:31.723
that my emotions are deeper than then
when did I break up with my exes?

519
00:31:37.186 --> 00:31:40.023
{\an8}She worked like crazy all her life.

520
00:31:40.106 --> 00:31:42.984
Always better in studies,
even graduated from university early.

521
00:31:43.610 --> 00:31:45.612
She founded it as a student
dessert company

522
00:31:45.695 --> 00:31:47.822
which has become better in seven years.

523
00:31:47.906 --> 00:31:49.949
Then she moved to "Mire Nutrition"

524
00:31:50.617 --> 00:31:53.036
after the acquisition of "Mire Group".

525
00:31:53.119 --> 00:31:56.706
"MIRE NUTRITION"

526
00:31:56.789 --> 00:31:58.750
Until tomorrow, our company has…

527
00:32:02.086 --> 00:32:03.129
go up again

528
00:32:04.589 --> 00:32:05.632
Despite everything.

529
00:32:15.850 --> 00:32:18.061
- Good morning.
- Good morning, madam.

530
00:32:18.811 --> 00:32:20.271
The morning is not good now.

531
00:32:20.355 --> 00:32:22.190
We lost 260 billion won.

532
00:32:23.232 --> 00:32:25.944
Now we are constantly
we publish rebuttal articles.

533
00:32:26.027 --> 00:32:26.945
They don't work.

534
00:32:27.028 --> 00:32:30.114
We will act against fake news
and hateful comments by law.

535
00:32:30.198 --> 00:32:31.324
That doesn't work either.

536
00:32:32.158 --> 00:32:34.243
Maybe we'll just wait?

537
