And that's not the end!

808
00:53:50.101 --> 00:53:51.603
A madman is trying to kill me

809
00:53:51.686 --> 00:53:54.898
and i don't even know
who is he and why does he wish me death!

810
00:53:56.983 --> 00:53:58.318
Why are you doing this to me?

811
00:53:58.401 --> 00:53:59.819
What did I do?

812
00:54:06.952 --> 00:54:07.911
Why did you do that?

813
00:54:10.080 --> 00:54:11.498
I wanted to check something.

814
00:54:11.998 --> 00:54:14.125
Then you should have told me in advance.

815
00:54:14.709 --> 00:54:15.752
if i told you

816
00:54:16.628 --> 00:54:17.671
you would refuse

817
00:54:21.466 --> 00:54:22.384
Scoundrel.

818
00:54:41.486 --> 00:54:42.654
I don't owe you anything.

819
00:55:06.302 --> 00:55:08.888
If this is not the case, how can I get it back?

820
00:55:11.850 --> 00:55:13.560
What the hell are you doing here?

821
00:55:14.394 --> 00:55:17.897
I spied on To To Hee
as you told me.

822
00:55:22.902 --> 00:55:24.320
It belongs to whoever found it.

823
00:55:26.322 --> 00:55:27.824
So what's going on?

824
00:55:27.907 --> 00:55:30.577
I thought you would charm her
instead of swimming together.

825
00:55:30.660 --> 00:55:31.870
keep quiet

826
00:56:04.569 --> 00:56:06.279
<i>Is this Mrs To To Hee?</i>

827
00:56:06.362 --> 00:56:09.157
<i>I Cha Tae Chun,
head of the financial department of Mire Group.</i>

828
00:56:09.741 --> 00:56:12.035
<i>For now, I can only tell you,</i>

829
00:56:12.118 --> 00:56:15.330
<i>what it can do to you
head of "Mire Group".</i>

830
00:56:54.244 --> 00:56:58.248
CEO TO TO HI

831
00:57:13.388 --> 00:57:14.556
TO TO HI

832
00:57:36.870 --> 00:57:38.746
Let Your Kingdom come.

833
00:57:38.830 --> 00:57:42.625
May your will be done
both in heaven and on earth.

834
00:57:43.418 --> 00:57:45.628
Lord, give me courage.

835
00:57:46.963 --> 00:57:49.090
Give me courage to face the truth.

836
00:58:31.424 --> 00:58:32.425
POMPOM PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

837
00:58:33.009 --> 00:58:33.843
Cute, isn't it?

838
00:58:34.469 --> 00:58:35.762
Do you want one for yourself?

839
00:58:46.314 --> 00:58:47.565
<i>I will connect you now.</i>

840
00:58:47.649 --> 00:58:49.609
<i>Be sure to post a rebuttal.</i>

841
00:58:49.692 --> 00:58:51.486
Do as I say!

842
00:58:51.569 --> 00:58:54.822
I can refute the article,
which she published herself, right?

843
00:58:55.949 --> 00:58:57.075
To To Hee.

844
00:58:58.201 --> 00:58:59.744
I will kill you.

845
00:59:05.917 --> 00:59:07.335
FEEDING THE WORLD FINANCES
GENERAL DIRECTOR: TO TO HI

846
00:59:50.003 --> 00:59:53.548
FINANCIAL HEAD OF THE GROUP MR. CHA
FOUND HANGING IN THE DRESSING ROOM

847
01:00:03.725 --> 01:00:06.644
<i>Salvation comes after destruction,</i>

848
01:00:07.562 --> 01:00:10.607
<i>when the familiar world around crumbles,</i>

849
01:00:10.690 --> 01:00:12.692
<i>and what was normal,</i>

850
01:00:12.775 --> 01:00:16.195
<i>ceases to be normal.</i>

851
01:01:24.055 --> 01:01:25.682
<i>This man</i>

852
01:01:26.974 --> 01:01:28.726
<i>broke into my difficult life.</i>

853
01:01:30.812 --> 01:01:34.065
<i>The man is more obscure
and suspicious than all the rest.</i>

854
01:01:35.400 --> 01:01:36.526
<i>Ku Vone, my salvation.</i>

855
01:01:49.706 --> 01:01:52.375
MY BELOVED DEMON

856
01:02:27.660 --> 01:02:30.204
{\an8}It is likely that you are a target.

857
01:02:30.288 --> 01:02:31.289
{\an8}<i>Do you suspect someone?</i>

858
01:02:31.372 --> 01:02:32.999
{\an8}<i>I don't know who's hating
me so as to do it.</i>

859
01:02:33.082 --> 01:02:34.125
{\an8}<i>You will pay for what you have done.</i>

860
01:02:34.208 --> 01:02:35.251
{\an8}You will be my bodyguard.

861
01:02:35.334 --> 01:02:37.545
{\an8}You tell me to protect
some insignificant person?

862
01:02:37.628 --> 01:02:39.005
{\an8}<i>What will happen to my dad if I die?</i>

863
01:02:39.088 --> 01:02:41.215
{\an8}Stand before me. I'll cover your back.

864
01:02:41.299 --> 01:02:42.925
{\an8}What is the security here?

865
01:02:43.009 --> 01:02:45.094
{\an8}<i>Is it so hard to stay safe?</i>

866
01:02:45.178 --> 01:02:47.180
{\an8}<i>Then be her guardian,
if you are so worried.</i>

867
01:02:47.263 --> 01:02:48.931
{\an8}<i>My dad is safe on her wrist.</i>

868
01:02:49.015 --> 01:02:50.016
{\an8}He saved me again.

869
01:02:50.099 --> 01:02:51.976
{\an8}Maybe the situation is not too bad.

870
01:02:52.059 --> 01:02:53.102
{\an8}Do you smell burning?

871
01:02:53.186 --> 01:02:54.479
{\an8}<i>Spontaneous ignition</i>

872
01:02:54.562 --> 01:02:55.897
{\an8}<i>began.</i>

873
01:03:01.944 --> 01:03:06.949
Translation of subtitles: Daria Hochel

